.TH CAMERA_INIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
camera_init \- Reset a camera for a view of view_w x view_h logical pixels (normally e\->logical_w, e\->logical_h), positioned at the origin with zoom 1, no bounds and no offset
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcamera.h\(dq
.BI "void camera_init(Camera *c, int view_w, int view_h);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reset a camera for a view of view_w x view_h logical pixels (normally e\->logical_w, e\->logical_h), positioned at the origin with zoom 1, no bounds and no offset. Call in on_enter, then set pos (or camera_follow with smoothing 0) so the first frame is not centered on 0,0.
.SH MODULE
camera (src/engine/camera/camera.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR camera_follow (3),
.BR camera_to_screen (3),
.BR Camera (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
